<MudStack Spacing="4">
    <MudStack AlignItems="@AlignItems.Center" Row>
        <MudIcon
            Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Emergency"
            Color="@Color.Error"
            Size="@Size.Large"/>

        <MudText Typo="@Typo.h6">
            Help is within reach
        </MudText>
    </MudStack>

    <MudText>
        The Overlay's Emergency Service Integrations view gives you a place to report an emergency
        and request a search and rescue service while playing Star Citizen.
    </MudText>
    <MudText>
        Open Emergency Services using the emergency button in the lower-left corner of the Overlay,
        then choose a service provider to request help.
    </MudText>

    <MudText Typo="@Typo.body2" Class="text-secondary">
        Established service providers can also contact Arkanis to discuss offering their services in the Overlay.
        In that case you can reach us at
        <a href="mailto:business+overlay@Arkanis.cc?subject=Service%20Provider%20Feature%20Inquiry">
            bussiness@arkanis.cc
        </a>.
    </MudText>
</MudStack>
